{"articleNo":"68626","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=68626&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년도 서울시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.10.25","hit":"6144","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012년도 하반기 학자금 대출이자 지원 신청 안내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">서울특별시</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">는「서울지역 대학생」들에게 학자금 대출 이자를 지원함을</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">알려드리니 다음과 같이 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt dotted; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt dotted; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; PADDING-LEFT: 1.41pt; WIDTH: 464.37pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.41pt; HEIGHT: 55.38pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt dotted; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt dotted; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울지역대학생이란 서울에 주소를 두고 서울소재 대학교에 재학 중이거</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">나, 서</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">울소재 고교를 졸업하고 타지역 대학에 재학 중인 자(휴학생</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">？</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대학원생 제외</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;사 업 명 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울시 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원(든든장학금 제외)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지원대상 : 한국장학재단에 대출 신청일 현재 기초생활수습권자와 소득 10분위 중 하위 1분위부터 7분위에 해당되는 서울특별시민 또는 그 자녀( “서울지역 대학생”)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문(신명조10)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">지원범위 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">일반상환 학자금 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">소득 7분위(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대출당시)</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 이하 계층 본인 부담 이자액</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 지원액 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">기초,1~3분위 전액, 4~5분위 개인부담액의 90%, 6~7분위 개인 부담액의 70%(단 정부지원이 있을 경우 정부지원 포함)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문(신명조10)\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양신명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">다만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">다자녀(3인 이상) 가구 둘째부터는 소득수준과 상관없이 </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">신청시 50%지원</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">신청조건 : 서울소재 고교졸업자로 타지역대학에 재학 중인 학생 및 다자녀가구 둘째부터인 서울지역 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">서울에 주소를 두고 서울소재 대학교에 재학 중인 대학생과 </span></u><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy\">상반기 신청자는 별도 신청없이 휴학여부 등 확인후 일괄지원</span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;신청기간 : ‘12. 9.28, 10:00(금) ~ '12. 12. 3, 18:00(월) </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;접 수 처 : 서울시 홈페이지<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr//webeditor/pages/www.seoul.go.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">www.seoul.go.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;대상자확정 : ‘12 . 12. 15일(예정)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 20pt\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;이자지원 방법 : 대학생 개인별 상환계좌 입금(한국장학재단)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"18\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 한양중고딕\">※ 기타 문의사항은 서울시 120번 콜센터로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
